field-fontsize-value="36" data-field-left-res-1200-value="87"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777614'>ИИ делает «что».<br>Вы решаете «где», «как» и «почему».</div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759984945497' data-elem-id='1759984945497' data-elem-type='shape' data-field-top-value="20" data-field-left-value="20" data-field-height-value="100" data-field-width-value="100" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-top-res-1200-value="262" data-field-left-res-1200-value="680" data-field-height-res-1200-value="248" data-field-width-res-1200-value="500"> <div class='tn-atom'> </div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777664' data-elem-id='1759910777664' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="370" data-field-left-value="838" data-field-height-value="120" data-field-width-value="469" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="370" data-field-left-res-1200-value="698"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777664'>Создание MVP под конкретные задачи бизнеса.<br>Интеграция готовых ИИ-инструментов (чат-боты, аналитика, компьютерное зрение и т. д.).<br>Кастомизация решений под российские реалии (язык, законодательство, инфраструктура).</div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777623' data-elem-id='1759910777623' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="282" data-field-left-value="838" data-field-height-value="100" data-field-width-value="469" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="282" data-field-left-res-1200-value="698"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777623'>Разработка и адаптация <br>ИИ-решений<br><br><br></div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759984845538' data-elem-id='1759984845538' data-elem-type='shape' data-field-top-value="108" data-field-left-value="470" data-field-height-value="100" data-field-width-value="100" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-top-res-1200-value="262" data-field-left-res-1200-value="20" data-field-height-res-1200-value="443" data-field-width-res-1200-value="631"> <div class='tn-atom'> </div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777629' data-elem-id='1759910777629' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="613" data-field-left-value="136" data-field-height-value="144" data-field-width-value="657" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="541" data-field-left-res-1200-value="38" data-field-width-res-1200-value="585"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777629'><br><br>Какие ИИ-решения востребованы в разных нишах (ритейл, производство, услуги, логистика и т. д.). Выявление "болевых точек" бизнеса, где ИИ даст быстрый эффект (автоматизация, прогнозирование, персонализация).</div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777632' data-elem-id='1759910777632' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="282" data-field-left-value="136" data-field-height-value="50" data-field-width-value="577" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="282" data-field-left-res-1200-value="38" data-field-height-res-1200-value="50" data-field-width-res-1200-value="526"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777632'>Анализ и выявление потребностей бизнеса и исследование рынка</div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759984972951' data-elem-id='1759984972951' data-elem-type='shape' data-field-top-value="20" data-field-left-value="20" data-field-height-value="100" data-field-width-value="100" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-top-res-1200-value="530" data-field-left-res-1200-value="681" data-field-height-res-1200-value="248" data-field-width-res-1200-value="500" data-field-widthmode-res-1200-value="fixed" data-field-heightmode-res-1200-value="fixed"> <div class='tn-atom'> </div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777637' data-elem-id='1759910777637' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="633" data-field-left-value="841" data-field-height-value="120" data-field-width-value="480" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="638" data-field-left-res-1200-value="699" data-field-width-res-1200-value="479"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777637'>Техническая интеграция с существующими системами компаний (1С, CRM, ERP).<br>Обучение сотрудников клиентов работе с ИИ.<br>Техподдержка и доработка решений по обратной связи.<br></div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777640' data-elem-id='1759910777640' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="538" data-field-left-value="846" data-field-height-value="25" data-field-width-value="475" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="550" data-field-left-res-1200-value="699" data-field-width-res-1200-value="474"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777640'>Внедрение и поддержка</div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759984615611' data-elem-id='1759984615611' data-elem-type='shape' data-field-top-value="785" data-field-left-value="120" data-field-height-value="248" data-field-width-value="692" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-top-res-1200-value="725" data-field-left-res-1200-value="20" data-field-width-res-1200-value="631"> <div class='tn-atom'> </div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777645' data-elem-id='1759910777645' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="899" data-field-left-value="137" data-field-height-value="120" data-field-width-value="657" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="833" data-field-left-res-1200-value="37" data-field-width-res-1200-value="597"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777645'><br><br>Выбор модели продаж: подписка, разовые внедрения, revenue share. Партнерства с вендорами (например, Яндекс, Сбер, отечественные ИИ-стартапы).<br></div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777647' data-elem-id='1759910777647' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="803" data-field-left-value="137" data-field-height-value="25" data-field-width-value="454" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="745" data-field-left-res-1200-value="37" data-field-width-res-1200-value="490"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777647'>Монетизация и масштабирование</div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759985031379' data-elem-id='1759985031379' data-elem-type='shape' data-field-top-value="20" data-field-left-value="20" data-field-height-value="100" data-field-width-value="100" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-top-res-1200-value="798" data-field-left-res-1200-value="683" data-field-height-res-1200-value="443" data-field-width-res-1200-value="497" data-field-widthmode-res-1200-value="fixed"> <div class='tn-atom'> </div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777651' data-elem-id='1759910777651' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="1138" data-field-left-value="838" data-field-height-value="144" data-field-width-value="424" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="1077" data-field-left-res-1200-value="703" data-field-width-res-1200-value="416"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777651'><br><br>Демонстрация ROI (как ИИ сэкономит или заработает для бизнеса). Кейсы и пилотные проекты для сарафанного маркетинга.<br>Участие в грантах и акселераторах .</div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777654' data-elem-id='1759910777654' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="806" data-field-left-value="838" data-field-height-value="25" data-field-width-value="464" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="818" data-field-left-res-1200-value="701"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777654'>Маркетинг и продажи </div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759984679078' data-elem-id='1759984679078' data-elem-type='shape' data-field-top-value="1044" data-field-left-value="124" data-field-height-value="248" data-field-width-value="692" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-widthmode-value="fixed" data-field-top-res-1200-value="993" data-field-left-res-1200-value="20" data-field-width-res-1200-value="631"> <div class='tn-atom'> </div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777659' data-elem-id='1759910777659' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="1155" data-field-left-value="138" data-field-height-value="120" data-field-width-value="649" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="1101" data-field-left-res-1200-value="38" data-field-width-res-1200-value="605"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777659'><br><br>Соответствие ФЗ-152 (персональные данные), отраслевым стандартам. Работа с отечественными облачными платформами (если требуется).<br></div> </div> <div class='t396__elem tn-elem tn-elem__14068368111759910777661' data-elem-id='1759910777661' data-elem-type='text' data-field-top-value="1082" data-field-left-value="138" data-field-height-value="25" data-field-width-value="657" data-field-axisy-value="top" data-field-axisx-value="left" data-field-container-value="grid" data-field-topunits-value="px" data-field-leftunits-value="px" data-field-heightunits-value="px" data-field-widthunits-value="px" data-field-textfit-value="autoheight" data-field-fontsize-value="20" data-field-top-res-1200-value="1013" data-field-left-res-1200-value="38" data-field-width-res-1200-value="524"> <div class='tn-atom'field='tn_text_1759910777661'>Юридические и регуляторные вопросы</div> </div> </div> </div> <script>t_onFuncLoad('t396_initialScale',function() {t396_initialScale('1406836811');});t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t396_init',function() {t396_init('1406836811');});});</script> <!-- /T396 --> </div> <div id="rec1408698341" class="r t-rec t-rec_pt_30 t-rec_pb_0 t-screenmax-980px" style="padding-top:30px;padding-bottom:0px;background-color:#f4f4f4; " data-record-type="1206" data-screen-max="980px" data-bg-color="#f4f4f4"> <!-- t1206 --> <div class="t1206"> <div class="t-container t-container_flex t1206__container_vtop"> <div class="t-col t-col_6"> <div class="t1206__content t1206__content_sticky"> <div class="t1206__header t-align_center"> <div class="t1206__uptitle t-uptitle t-uptitle_sm t-animate"
field="subtitle" data-animate-style="fadeinup" data-animate-group="yes"> <br /><span style="font-size: 36px; font-family: Unbounded;">ИИ&nbsp;делает «что». </span><br /><span style="font-size: 36px; font-family: Unbounded;">Вы&nbsp;решаете «где», «как» и&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 36px;">«</span><span style="font-size: 36px; font-family: Unbounded;">почему</span><span style="font-size: 36px;">».</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="t-col t-col_6 t1206__col-bottom"> <ul class="t1206__features t-card__container"
role="list" data-columns-in-row="1"> <li class="t1206__feature t-item t-card__col t-animate" data-animate-style="fadeinup" data-animate-chain="yes"> <div class="t1206__card"> <div class="t1206__card-text-wrap"> <div class="t1206__card-title t-name t-name_md" field="li_title__7110912602810">Анализ и&nbsp;выявление потребностей бизнеса и&nbsp;исследование рынка</div> <div class="t1206__card-descr t-descr t-descr_sm" field="li_descr__7110912602810">Какие ИИ-решения востребованы в&nbsp;разных нишах (ритейл, производство, услуги, логистика и&nbsp;т.&nbsp;д.). Выявление «болевых точек» бизнеса, где&nbsp;ИИ даст быстрый эффект (автоматизация, прогнозирование, персонализация).</div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="t1206__feature t-item t-card__col t-animate" data-animate-style="fadeinup" data-animate-chain="yes"> <div class="t1206__card"> <div class="t1206__card-text-wrap"> <div class="t1206__card-title t-name t-name_md" field="li_title__7110912602811">Разработка и адаптация ИИ-решений</div> <div class="t1206__card-descr t-descr t-descr_sm" field="li_descr__7110912602811">Создание MVP под конкретные задачи бизнеса. Интеграция готовых ИИ-инструментов (чат-боты, аналитика, компьютерное зрение и т. д.). Кастомизация решений под российские реалии (язык, законодательство, инфраструктура).</div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="t1206__feature t-item t-card__col t-animate" data-animate-style="fadeinup" data-animate-chain="yes"> <div class="t1206__card"> <div class="t1206__card-text-wrap"> <div class="t1206__card-title t-name t-name_md" field="li_title__7110912602812">Монетизация и&nbsp;масштабирование</div> <div class="t1206__card-descr t-descr t-descr_sm" field="li_descr__7110912602812">Выбор модели продаж: подписка, разовые внедрения, revenue share. Партнерства с вендорами (например, Яндекс, Сбер, отечественные ИИ-стартапы).</div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="t1206__feature t-item t-card__col t-animate" data-animate-style="fadeinup" data-animate-chain="yes"> <div class="t1206__card"> <div class="t1206__card-text-wrap"> <div class="t1206__card-title t-name t-name_md" field="li_title__1760006683683">Юридические и&nbsp;регуляторные вопросы</div> <div class="t1206__card-descr t-descr t-descr_sm" field="li_descr__1760006683683">Соответствие ФЗ-152 (персональные данные), отраслевым стандартам. Работа с отечественными облачными платформами (если требуется).</div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="t1206__feature t-item t-card__col t-animate" data-animate-style="fadeinup" data-animate-chain="yes"> <div class="t1206__card"> <div class="t1206__card-text-wrap"> <div class="t1206__card-title t-name t-name_md" field="li_title__1760006707848">Маркетинг и продажи </div> <div class="t1206__card-descr t-descr t-descr_sm" field="li_descr__1760006707848">Демонстрация ROI (как&nbsp;ИИ сэкономит или заработает для бизнеса). Кейсы и&nbsp;пилотные проекты для сарафанного маркетинга. Участие в&nbsp;грантах и&nbsp;акселераторах .</div> </div> </div> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <style>#rec1408698341 .t1206__card{background-color:#9cc0da;}#rec1408698341 .t1206__card:hover{background-color:#c4ff72;}#rec1408698341 .t1206__content_sticky{top:100px;}</style> <script>t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t__paintIcons',function() {t__paintIcons('1408698341','.t1206__card-img, .t1206__card-bgimg');});});</script> <style>#rec1408698341 .t1206__uptitle{color:#08020e;font-family:'Unbounded';letter-spacing:1px;}@media screen and (min-width:900px){#rec1408698341 .t1206__uptitle{font-size:36px;line-height:1;}}@media screen and (min-width:480px) and (max-width:900px){#rec1408698341 .t1206__uptitle{font-size:24px;}}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec1408698341 .t1206__uptitle{font-size:24px;line-height:1;}}#rec1408698341 .t1206__title{color:#c4ff72;}#rec1408698341 .t1206__card-title{font-size:24px;font-family:'Unbounded';}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec1408698341 .t1206__card